<BaseLayout title="Hands-On Product Reviews | Buy Better Finds" description="Independent hands-on product reviews, real-world testing and transparent product disclosures from Buy Better Finds.">
<article class="article">
<div class="eyebrow">Buy Better Finds Review Team</div>
<h1>Hands-On Product Reviews</h1>
<p class="lead">Real products. Practical testing. Independent opinions.</p>
<p>Our hands-on review program is launching. As products are tested, this page will feature original photos, real-world observations, strengths, limitations, and clear recommendations. We only label a review “hands-on tested” when the product has actually been used by our reviewer.</p>
<div class="card" style="margin:2rem 0;padding:1.5rem">
<h2>What to expect from our reviews</h2>
<ul>
<li>Original photographs of the actual product when available</li>
<li>How and how long we tested it</li>
<li>What worked, what did not, and who it suits</li>
<li>Clear disclosure of purchased, gifted, or loaned products</li>
<li>Affiliate links identified where applicable</li>
</ul>
</div>
<h2>Reviews are coming</h2>
<p>We will publish individual reviews here after testing is complete. Until then, browse our <a href="/guides/">buying guides</a> and <a href="/comparisons/">product comparisons</a>, which are research-based and are not presented as firsthand tests.</p>
<h2>Are you a manufacturer?</h2>
<p>We consider products for independent editorial review. Sending a product does not guarantee publication or favorable coverage.</p>
<p><a class="btn primary" href="/review-submissions/">Submit a product for consideration →</a></p>
<p>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:info@buybetterfinds.com">info@buybetterfinds.com</a>.</p>
</article>
</BaseLayout>